Suggests: fex-emu-config
Description: fast usermode x86 and x86-64 emulator for ARM64 (Aurora build)
 FEX runs x86 and x86-64 Linux programs on an AArch64 host. This build comes
 from Aurora's fork. It uses the hardware TSO memory model when the kernel
 offers it, keeps the x86 parity and adjust flags in hardware on Apple cores,
 and runs in the 4 KiB page process trees that Aurora kernels provide (see
 README.aurora).
 .
 x86 programs need an x86-64 root filesystem; FEXRootFSFetcher downloads
 one.

Package: fex-emu-config
Architecture: arm64
Build-Profiles: <!cross>
Depends:
