 qml6-module-qtquick-controls,
 qml6-module-qtquick-dialogs,
 qml6-module-qtquick-layouts,
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: graphical configuration editor for FEX (Aurora build)
 FEXConfig edits a user's FEX configuration: the root filesystem, per-app
 settings and emulation options.

Package: fex-emu-steam
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: FEX as a Steam compatibility tool, "FEX (Aurora)"
 FEX from Aurora's fork, built as a Steam compatibility tool (the fork's
 FEXCompatTool and FEXServerManager). Steam's native ARM64 client lists it
 as "FEX (Aurora)" and can run x86 Linux titles with it instead of Valve's
 FEX tool.
